msgstr "Vaicājumu pakalpojuma URL"

#: setup.php
msgid "Base URL of the FlowView Query Service, for example http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Leave blank to auto-discover the ephemeral port from the service's port file."
msgstr "FlowView vaicājumu pakalpojuma bāzes URL, piemēram, http://127.0.0.1:8699. Atstājiet tukšu, lai automātiski noteiktu pagaidu portu no pakalpojuma porta faila."

